 <h3><u>Tere Mehmaan aaye hai shiree\'n</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>HAYE AFSOS TU NA PEHCHANI ..(4)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</p> 
  <p>KARARBALA SE LUTE LUTAAY HUEY TERE MEHMAAN AAYE HAI SHEERIN &nbsp;<br> APNA WADA NIBHANE NIZO PER KHUCH MUSALMAAN AAYE HAIN SHEERIN&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</p> 
  <p>GHAR&nbsp; SAJA APNA BE GHARO’N KE LEYE, CHADAREN LAKE DE SARON KE LEYE &nbsp;<br> SAR PE GHURBAT KI DHOOB ODHEY HUEY&nbsp; SAB&nbsp; PARESHAAN AAYE HAIN SHEERIN</p> 
  <p>EK KAATE SAR SE AARAHI THI SADA, TERE AAQA KE PAAS KUCH NA BACHA<br> KOI TOHFA NA LAAYE TERE LEYE HUM PASHEMAAN AAYE HAI N SHEERIN</p> 
  <p>TERA GHAR AUR KAHAN RASOOL KI AAL,KAR NABI ZADIYON KA ISTEQBAL&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br> AAJ TERE GHARIB KHANE PER DEE’N KE SULTAN AAYE HAIN SHEERIN&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</p> 
  <p>WHO JO ATHAHRA SAAL KA SAR HAI, UMME LAILA KE LAAL KA SAR HAI<br> MAA KE HUMRAH KHOON ME GHAILTA’N&nbsp; MAA KE ARMAAN AAYE&nbsp; HAIN SHEERIN</p> 
  <p>SHEH KA GHUNCHA DAHEN BHI AAYA HAI,QASIM E GUL BADAN BHI AAYA HAI<br> DEKH APNE LAHOO ME DOOB E HUEY KITNE QURAAN&nbsp; AAYE HAIN SHEERIN&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</p> 
  <p>SAATH ABBAS E NAAMDAR BHI HAI,TERE AAQA KE&nbsp; JAANISAR BHI HAI<br> RAAH TAKTI THI JINKI KHUWABO’N ME&nbsp; LE WOH INSAAN AAYE HAIN SHEERIN</p> 
  <p>KYA KAHE DASTAN E BARBADI, RO KE KAHTI THI HAR NABI ZADI<br> KHOKE APNA MUSAFERAT ME SABHI SAZO SAMAAN AAYE HAIN SHEERIN</p> 
  <p>HAI KAHAN AB DIL E BATOOL KO CHAIN, LUT GAYI RAN ME KAIYENAAT E HUSSAIN<br> BANN KE SAJJAD APNE BABA KE MARSIYA KHUWAAN&nbsp; AAYE HAIN SHEERIN</p> 
  <p>DIL LARAZTA HAI AAMIR O AKHTAR,JAB YEH KAHTI ‘N THI ZAINAB E MUZTAR<br> BE RIDAYI ME SHAHRE KHUFA KE RASTE CHAAN AAYE HAIN SHEERIN</p> 
